          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This build is missing its licensing configuration" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此版本缺少授權設定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This cannot be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此動作無法復原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is a real dictation with your chosen model. It also appears in History." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是使用你所選模型的真實聽寫，也會出現在「記錄」中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This license is no longer active" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此授權已失效"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This only clears the saved activation on this Mac. It cannot release a device slot in Polar. For a rotated key, use Update Key instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這只會清除這台 Mac 上已儲存的啟用資訊，無法釋放 Polar 中的裝置名額。若已更換授權碼，請改用「更新授權碼」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This profile keeps your exact words" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這個模式會保留你說的每個字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This profile skips tidying. %@ tidies profiles that use refinement." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這個模式不整理文字。%@ 會整理使用潤稿的模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This profile skips tidying. Apple Intelligence can tidy profiles that use refinement, on this Mac with no key." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這個模式不整理文字。Apple Intelligence 可以在這台 Mac 上整理使用潤稿的模式，不需要金鑰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This profile skips tidying. Apple Intelligence tidies profiles that use refinement." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這個模式不整理文字。Apple Intelligence 會整理使用潤稿的模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This profile skips tidying. To tidy words, set up refinement in Models and use a profile that refines." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這個模式不整理文字。若要整理文字，請在「模型」中設定潤稿，並使用會潤稿的模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This recording is no longer available. Refresh History to update the list." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此錄音已無法使用。請重新整理「記錄」以更新列表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This release uses ad-hoc signing. macOS may require these steps again after an update." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此版本使用臨時簽署。更新後 macOS 可能會要求再次執行這些步驟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This releases its device slot. Your history, models and provider keys stay on this Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這會釋放裝置名額。你的記錄、模型與供應商金鑰會留在這台 Mac 上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Throws away what you just said." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
